1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,638
Clausius found a way to turn the second law from a prohibition into an equation.

2
00:00:05,638 --> 00:00:09,661
He defined a new state function, entropy, S.

3
00:00:09,661 --> 00:00:18,372
When a small amount of heat d Q is transferred reversibly at absolute temperature T, the change in entropy is d Q over T.

4
00:00:18,372 --> 00:00:20,807
Its unit is joules per kelvin.

